cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NTM Virtual Lab in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NTM Virtual Lab: an open virtual laboratory for non-traditional machining processes"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based virtual laboratory for 20 non-traditional, hybrid and nano-finishing
  machining processes (USM, AJM, WJM, AWJM, CHM, ECM, EDM, WEDM, LBM, EBM, PAM, ECG,
  ECDM, RUM, LAM, AFM, MAF, MRF, CMP, IBM). Each experiment provides theory with
  nomenclature, pre- and post-tests, an interactive machine set-up with safety
  interlocks, parametric simulation with alternative removal-rate models, randomised
  numericals, validation against published data, and a lab report with uncertainty
  analysis.
authors:
